      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did this so that in http://r.android.com/927198 we could also clear and restore the calling identity. Originally I did just have the check in each one, and changed to this in a separate CL before the calling identity change.\n\nOnce we add in the clearing of the calling identity it seemed like a worthwhile change to me, since there is a restore step that happens after the operation. It seemed like a good way to ensure all operations had consistent behavior.\n\nIf you do not like it there either, I can change it though.",
